OL,3,GNEWSAConcerns raised about 'ongoing'
OL,4,Alay-by fly-tipping
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe founder of a litter picking group
OL,7,Fhas raised concerns about ongoing
OL,8,Ffly-tipping in a lay-by.
OL,10,FGas canisters and fridges are among
OL,11,Frubbish dumped in a lay-by off the
OL,12,FB4100 near Elmsbrook, north of
OL,13,FBicester.
OL,15,FJamie Jessett, founder of Bicester
OL,16,FLitter Pickers, told the BBC there was
OL,17,Fa similar issue in 2023 and that the
OL,18,Fissue has "got so much worse".
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
