OL,3,GNEWSAConcerns raised about 'ongoing'
OL,4,Alay-by fly-tipping
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for Cherwell District
OL,7,FCouncil said: "The team are aware of
OL,8,Fthe ongoing issues on this site and
OL,9,Fwill continue to clear this where they
OL,10,Fcan."
